  text=c.get('content','').lower()
  if any(s in text for s in ['renumber','re-number','re-nmber','renumbeir','numbering']):
   msg='Acknowledged. This reference is included in the first-mention renumbering audit. I will update the manuscript reference, sheet name/order and workbook index together, incorporating the new genomic breakdown table and software table. I am waiting to identify your edited workbook copy so that the S5 heat map/row order and S22 column deletion are preserved. This is pending reconciliation, not completed renumbering.'
